//! Text in doc comments must never become markup of its own (spec/doc.md DC5).

/// A <script>alert(1)</script> tag, an [unsafe link](javascript:alert(1)), and a [good link](https://example.org/a?b=1&c=2).
///
/// <img src=x onerror=alert(1)>
///
/// ```
/// let s = "<b>not bold</b> & more"
/// ```
fn hostile() {}

fn main() {
    hostile()
}
